Wait — `GivenPosts` with anonymous types won't compile since I used anonymous objects in calls. Let me fix: use tuples `(string Title, int Views)` in the calls instead. I'll rewrite the calls as `await GivenPosts(new[] { ("Low", 10), ... })`.

